WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.570 --> 00:00:05.090
Darth Vader’s story has been incorporated
into every aspect of the Star Wars saga, from

00:00:05.090 --> 00:00:07.600
films to shows, comics, and books.

00:00:07.780 --> 00:00:12.900
So now, it's time to chart his entire course
from an enslaved boy on Tatooine to the inspiration

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:15.080
for the galaxy's current reigning big bad.

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:17.580
This is Darth Vader's story, explained.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.420
Four decades before he walked onto Princess
Leia's ship as the embodiment of the evil

00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:26.680
Empire, when audiences got their first glimpse
of Darth Vader, Anakin Skywalker was born

00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:30.360
on Tatooine as the child of a slave woman
named Shmi Skywalker.

00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:35.390
When the Jedi master Qui-Gon Jinn asked Shmi
about the boy's father years later, she simply

00:00:35.390 --> 00:00:39.670
told him that there wasn't one, leading Qui-Gon
to deduce that Anakin had been conceived by

00:00:39.670 --> 00:00:44.460
the Force entities known as midi-chlorians
. Though it hasn't been conclusively stated,

00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:49.060
it's heavily implied in both the film and
the comics that Anakin's conception was caused

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:54.040
by the manipulations of the Sith Lord Darth
Plagueis and his apprentice, Darth Sidious.

00:00:54.040 --> 00:00:58.440
Anakin showed tremendous intelligence and
skill from a very young age, and was so adept

00:00:58.450 --> 00:01:03.699
at mechanics and repairs that he built the
protocol droid C-3PO before he'd turned ten.

00:01:03.699 --> 00:01:08.720
He was also a skilled podracer, making him
a rarity as human reflexes were usually too

00:01:08.720 --> 00:01:12.920
slow to allow them to survive in the sport,
which drew the attention of a pair of Jedi

00:01:12.920 --> 00:01:13.560
knights.

00:01:14.320 --> 00:01:19.340
After learning about Anakin's curious parentage
and testing his midi-chlorian count, Qui-Gon

00:01:19.340 --> 00:01:21.900
became convinced of Anakin's potential as
a Jedi.

00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:26.860
With Qui-Gon's encouragement, Anakin won his
freedom in a podrace and accompanied Qui-Gon

00:01:26.869 --> 00:01:30.380
and Obi-Wan to Coruscant, sadly having to
leave his mother behind.

00:01:30.380 --> 00:01:34.729
Qui-Gon took Anakin before the Jedi High Council,
convinced that the boy could be the Chosen

00:01:34.729 --> 00:01:36.540
One who would bring balance to the Force.

00:01:36.600 --> 00:01:42.080
Masters Yoda and Mace Windu were wary of Anakin's
age and his fearful demeanor, but Qui-Gon

00:01:42.080 --> 00:01:44.080
pleaded for the opportunity to train him anyway.

00:01:44.080 --> 00:01:48.940
In the Battle of Naboo, Anakin piloted a starfighter
against the Trade Federation, proving that

00:01:48.940 --> 00:01:53.180
his Jedi reflexes and skill as a pilot extended
beyond podracing.

00:01:53.360 --> 00:01:57.479
After the battle was over, he discovered that
Qui-Gon had been killed at the hands of Darth

00:01:57.480 --> 00:02:01.980
Maul, and Obi-Wan made a vow to train Anakin
himself, in keeping with his lost master's

00:02:01.980 --> 00:02:02.480
wishes.

00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:05.980
The High Council consented, and Anakin became
a Jedi Padawan.

00:02:06.680 --> 00:02:11.640
Anakin spent the next decade training as Obi-Wan's
apprentice, and proved himself an immensely

00:02:11.640 --> 00:02:14.980
skilled Jedi who also had a tendency towards
recklessness.

00:02:15.040 --> 00:02:20.280
As a young man, he reconnected with then-Senator
Padme Amidala on Coruscant, when he and Obi-Wan

00:02:20.280 --> 00:02:23.340
were tasked with guarding her life after an
assassination attempt.

00:02:23.760 --> 00:02:27.360
"We will find out who's trying to kill you Padme.  I promise you."

00:02:27.860 --> 00:02:30.560
"We will not exceed our mandate, my young padawan learner."

00:02:30.940 --> 00:02:35.160
While Obi-Wan sought to track down the people
behind the attempt on Padme's life, Anakin

00:02:35.160 --> 00:02:39.060
stayed behind as her personal bodyguard and
escorted her back to Naboo.

00:02:39.190 --> 00:02:43.840
The senator and the Jedi soon fell in love,
but Anakin's darker tendencies intruded as

00:02:43.840 --> 00:02:46.340
he became tormented by visions of his mother.

00:02:46.440 --> 00:02:51.480
With Padme at his side, Anakin traveled to
Tatooine, where he learned that a now-married-and-freed

00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:54.700
Shmi Skywalker had been abducted by Tusken
raiders.

00:02:54.840 --> 00:02:58.780
Anakin tracked down the Tusken tribe and his
mother, who died in his arms after seeing

00:02:58.780 --> 00:02:59.760
him one last time.

00:03:00.050 --> 00:03:04.560
In a rage, Skywalker slaughtered the entire
tribe, and vowed to Padme that he would become

00:03:04.560 --> 00:03:09.460
powerful enough to prevent the people he loved
from dying, beginning his descent into darkness.

00:03:10.100 --> 00:03:15.060
After the Tusken raider incident, Anakin and
Padme left Tatooine to rescue Obi-Wan who'd

00:03:15.060 --> 00:03:16.690
been taken prisoner by Separatists.

00:03:16.980 --> 00:03:21.400
Unfortunately, they, like Obi-Wan were soon
captured by Separatist leader, Sith Lord,

00:03:21.400 --> 00:03:25.920
and former Dracula Count Dooku, and sentenced
to death in a gladiatorial arena.

00:03:26.200 --> 00:03:30.430
As they tried to fight their way out alongside
the Jedi, reinforcements arrived in the form

00:03:30.430 --> 00:03:32.780
a clone army that had been discovered by Obi-Wan.

00:03:32.960 --> 00:03:37.000
Under the leadership of Yoda and Mace Windu,
they defeated the Separatists in what would

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:39.040
become the first battle of the Clone Wars.

00:03:39.210 --> 00:03:44.180
With the battle still raging, Anakin and Obi-Wan
engaged Dooku in a lightsaber duel, but Anakin's

00:03:44.180 --> 00:03:47.780
recklessness got the better of him when he
tried to fight Dooku alone.

00:03:47.980 --> 00:03:52.690
The Sith defeated Anakin, cutting off Anakin's
right arm before being defeated by Yoda.

00:03:52.880 --> 00:03:57.660
In the days that followed, Anakin and Padme
were married in secret with the droids C-3PO

00:03:57.660 --> 00:04:02.860
and R2-D2 serving as witnesses because the
Jedi Order forbade such romantic attachments.

00:04:03.880 --> 00:04:08.360
As the Clone Wars gained intensity, Anakin
was promoted to Jedi Knight and became a key

00:04:08.360 --> 00:04:09.640
general for the Republic.

00:04:09.660 --> 00:04:14.540
His abilities and confidence grew, but so
too did his recklessness and, by extension,

00:04:14.540 --> 00:04:16.140
his fear of losing those he loved.

00:04:16.450 --> 00:04:20.720
In an effort to help, Yoda suggested Anakin
could learn how to let go of people by taking

00:04:20.720 --> 00:04:24.160
on an apprentice of his own who would one
day ascend beyond his training.

00:04:24.350 --> 00:04:29.120
He was paired with a young Padawan named Ahsoka
Tano, and while the two initially had friction

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:32.760
due to Ahsoka's feisty nature, they ultimately
became friends.

00:04:32.760 --> 00:04:37.400
"Master, if you've taught me one thing it's that nothing is easy when you're around."

00:04:37.480 --> 00:04:42.190
Ahsoka rose in prominence alongside her master
as the wars went on, until she was framed

00:04:42.190 --> 00:04:46.220
and arrested for a bombing at the Jedi Temple
that was actually carried out by one of her

00:04:46.220 --> 00:04:46.760
friends.

00:04:46.900 --> 00:04:51.720
Ahsoka was expelled from the Jedi Order, but
Anakin and Padme believed in her innocence,

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:55.210
and were ultimately able to gain evidence
that led to her acquittal at trial.

00:04:55.210 --> 00:04:59.220
Though she was offered re-admission to the
ranks of the Jedi, Ahsoka was disillusioned

00:04:59.220 --> 00:05:02.040
after her trial, and she chose to leave the
Jedi behind.

00:05:02.180 --> 00:05:06.780
Witnessing the treatment of his former apprentice
only served to further frustrate Anakin, who

00:05:06.780 --> 00:05:09.140
was beginning to lose faith in the Jedi High
Council.

00:05:10.340 --> 00:05:14.420
By the end of the Clone Wars, Anakin's growing
abilities and his purported status as the

00:05:14.420 --> 00:05:17.660
Chosen One caught the attention of the Sith
Lord Darth Sidious.

00:05:17.960 --> 00:05:22.620
Sidious was manipulating the entire war from
behind the scenes via his dual roles as a

00:05:22.620 --> 00:05:27.220
Sith and as Sheev Palpatine yes, that's his
first name the chancellor of the Republic.

00:05:27.340 --> 00:05:31.880
Palpatine finally made his move on Skywalker
in the waning days of the war, urging him

00:05:31.890 --> 00:05:36.060
to kill Dooku in cold blood in the midst of
space battle above Coruscant.

00:05:36.060 --> 00:05:40.860
Anakin complied, decapitating Dooku, and Palpatine
continued grooming Anakin as his agent by

00:05:40.860 --> 00:05:43.730
appointing him as his emissary to the Jedi
Council.

00:05:43.730 --> 00:05:47.690
The council submitted to the chancellor's
wishes, but they refused to grant Anakin the

00:05:47.690 --> 00:05:52.860
rank of Master, further inflaming his frustrations,
though Obi-Wan continued to champion him.

00:05:52.860 --> 00:05:57.280
"I have trained you since you were a small boy.  I've taugh you everything I know

00:05:57.940 --> 00:06:00.400
And you have become a far greater Jedi than I could ever hope to be."

00:06:01.080 --> 00:06:05.420
Unfortunately, the denial of Anakin's knighthood,
coupled with his frequent visions of Padme

00:06:05.430 --> 00:06:11.120
who was then pregnant dying in despair, led
Palpatine to finally reveal himself to Anakin,

00:06:11.120 --> 00:06:14.390
convincing him that he could stop the death
of his loved ones by using the Dark Side of

00:06:14.390 --> 00:06:14.920
the Force.

00:06:15.060 --> 00:06:19.520
Conflicted, Anakin first revealed that Palpatine
was a Sith Lord ... and then helped Palpatine

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:22.700
kill Mace Windu in the hopes of learning how
to save Padme.

00:06:22.870 --> 00:06:27.420
Though distressed by his betrayal of the Jedi,
Anakin submitted himself to his new master,

00:06:27.420 --> 00:06:29.320
who in turn dubbed him Darth Vader.

00:06:30.400 --> 00:06:35.000
Palpatine dispatched Vader to the Jedi Temple
as part of his Great Jedi Purge, where Vader

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:38.860
brutally slaughtered any Force user in his
path, including the children.

00:06:38.980 --> 00:06:43.580
Vader then journeyed to the fiery planet Mustafar,
with Obi-Wan and Padme, having learned of

00:06:43.580 --> 00:06:45.200
his betrayal, following to stop him.

00:06:45.510 --> 00:06:49.620
Enraged by the idea that his old master and
his wife were working together to betray him,

00:06:49.630 --> 00:06:54.430
he used the Force to choke Padme into unconsciousness,
then engaged Obi-Wan in a duel.

00:06:54.430 --> 00:06:58.690
Ultimately, Obi-Wan gained the high ground
in the fight, severed both of Vader's legs,

00:06:58.690 --> 00:07:00.600
and left him near a lava ditch to die.

00:07:00.700 --> 00:07:05.520
Palpatine saved his apprentice, then outfitted
him in a life-preserving suit of armor, transforming

00:07:05.520 --> 00:07:08.080
him into the half-machine Vader we all know
and love.

00:07:08.200 --> 00:07:12.920
Palpatine also told Vader that he'd accidentally
killed Padme and their unborn children back

00:07:12.920 --> 00:07:13.420
on Mustafar.

00:07:13.540 --> 00:07:18.340
In truth, Padme had died of a broken heart,
but not before secretly giving birth to Anakin's

00:07:18.340 --> 00:07:22.160
twin children, Luke and Leia, who were hidden
away from him as they grew up.

00:07:22.400 --> 00:07:27.120
Vader then took his place at Palpatine's side
as the Republic became the Galactic Empire,

00:07:27.120 --> 00:07:30.120
although he still harbored a desire to bring
Padme back at all costs.

00:07:31.260 --> 00:07:35.760
Two decades passed as the Empire continued
to rise, and Vader continued his efforts to

00:07:35.760 --> 00:07:37.360
eradicate the remaining Jedi.

00:07:37.520 --> 00:07:41.850
He also had to deal with Palpatine's schemes
to encourage his competitive nature by drafting

00:07:41.850 --> 00:07:45.260
other warriors who could serve as Vader's
replacement at the Emperor's side.

00:07:45.470 --> 00:07:50.100
It was during this era that Palpatine gifted
Vader a mask belonging to Momin, an ancient

00:07:50.100 --> 00:07:53.400
Sith Lord and artist, whose spirit still possessed
the mask.

00:07:53.580 --> 00:07:58.080
Vader used the gateway opened by Momin to
search for Padme's spirit and bring her back,

00:07:58.080 --> 00:08:01.900
but instead, he found darkness as her form
disintegrated before his eyes.

00:08:01.900 --> 00:08:06.240
Vader came out of the experience convinced
that both Padme and Anakin Skywalker were

00:08:06.240 --> 00:08:08.640
dead, and that his past no longer mattered.

00:08:09.440 --> 00:08:14.280
While Vader pursued his own interests, a revolutionary
movement formed, blossoming into the Rebel

00:08:14.280 --> 00:08:17.800
Alliance, a group which sought to wage all-out
war against the Empire.

00:08:18.000 --> 00:08:22.490
In those early days, Ahsoka Tano joined the
Alliance, dueling Vader to what he believed

00:08:22.490 --> 00:08:23.260
to be her death.

00:08:23.320 --> 00:08:27.880
The Rebellion gained an unexpected advantage
19 years after the fall of the Republic, when

00:08:27.880 --> 00:08:32.000
it managed to seize the plans to a planet-destroying
battle station called the Death Star.

00:08:32.260 --> 00:08:36.400
Vader led the pursuit of the Rebels and managed
to capture one of their leaders, Princess

00:08:36.420 --> 00:08:39.580
Leia Organa, who, unbeknownst to him, was
his long-lost daughter.

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:44.100
After destroying Leia's adopted planet of
Alderaan, Vader then had an unexpected encounter

00:08:44.100 --> 00:08:45.220
with an old friend.

00:08:45.570 --> 00:08:50.200
When a small group that included Obi-Wan Kenobi
infiltrated the Death Star to rescue Leia,

00:08:50.210 --> 00:08:53.339
the master and the apprentice decided it was
time for a rematch.

00:08:53.339 --> 00:08:57.810
This time, there was no high ground, and Vader
killed his old teacher, but the rescue was

00:08:57.810 --> 00:09:01.240
successful, and the Rebels were clear to use
the Death Star plans to attack.

00:09:01.460 --> 00:09:06.370
In the ensuing battle, Vader almost killed
Rebel pilot Luke Skywalker, his still-unknown,

00:09:06.370 --> 00:09:10.120
long-lost son, who would go on to destroy
the Death Star and give the Alliance their

00:09:10.120 --> 00:09:11.320
first big victory..

00:09:12.080 --> 00:09:16.440
After learning of Luke's true identity through
his agents, Vader finally tracked down his

00:09:16.440 --> 00:09:18.480
son at a hidden base on the ice planet Hoth.

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:22.740
While the Rebels escaped, Palpatine revealed
his knowledge of Luke to Vader, and the two

00:09:22.740 --> 00:09:26.380
began working to bring the younger Skywalker
over to the Dark Side.

00:09:26.640 --> 00:09:30.940
Vader captured Luke's friends, Han and Leia,
using them as bait to lure Luke away from

00:09:30.940 --> 00:09:34.640
his training with Yoda, who had been living
in hiding for the past two decades.

00:09:34.880 --> 00:09:38.940
The plan worked, and Luke arrived on Bespin
to battle Vader and save his friends.

00:09:38.940 --> 00:09:43.760
Vader defeated the young Jedi in a lightsaber
duel, severing Luke's right hand in the process,

00:09:43.760 --> 00:09:45.400
and revealed that he was Luke's father.

00:09:45.500 --> 00:09:50.140
Instead of joining the Dark Side, he decided
to fall to his death instead, but was rescued

00:09:50.140 --> 00:09:51.320
by Leia in the Falcon.

00:09:52.140 --> 00:09:56.440
Vader returned from Bespin to help oversee
construction of a second Death Star, planning

00:09:56.450 --> 00:10:00.760
with the Emperor to use the new superweapon
as bait to ensnare and defeat the Rebellion

00:10:00.760 --> 00:10:02.920
by making it look more vulnerable than it
was.

00:10:03.100 --> 00:10:07.300
Luke re-emerged on the forest moon of Endor,
allowing himself to be captured and taken

00:10:07.300 --> 00:10:08.180
to the Death Star.

00:10:08.360 --> 00:10:12.640
He was determined to redeem Vader, just as
Vader was determined to convert his son by

00:10:12.640 --> 00:10:14.320
bringing him before the Emperor.

00:10:14.420 --> 00:10:18.660
During the duel that followed, Vader sensed
in his son's mind that he had a sister, Vader's

00:10:18.660 --> 00:10:21.920
second child and used this knowledge to draw
out Luke's anger.

00:10:22.060 --> 00:10:25.680
Rather than giving into the Dark Side, though,
Luke tossed his weapon aside.

00:10:25.680 --> 00:10:30.640
This didn't sit well with Palpatine, who responded
by using Force lightning to electrocute Luke.

00:10:30.880 --> 00:10:34.060
Watching his son die, something suddenly switched
inside Vader.

00:10:34.240 --> 00:10:37.800
Weak and wounded, Vader managed to throw his
master into the core of the Death Star.

00:10:38.000 --> 00:10:42.510
With his dying breath, Anakin Skywalker returned
from the Dark Side and told his son that he

00:10:42.510 --> 00:10:44.160
was right about him all along.

00:10:44.860 --> 00:10:48.760
The Rebels' victory at the second Death Star
marked the beginning of the end for the Galactic

00:10:48.760 --> 00:10:49.260
Empire.

00:10:49.260 --> 00:10:53.560
Vader's legacy as a Dark Side legend lived
on, however, and took root again in the form

00:10:53.560 --> 00:10:56.410
of his grandson Leia and Han's kid, Ben Solo.

00:10:56.410 --> 00:11:01.180
Ben caught the eye of Snoke, a powerful Dark
Side user and scholar who sensed the Dark

00:11:01.180 --> 00:11:05.520
Side potential in the Skywalker bloodline,
and he sought to cultivate it within Ben.

00:11:05.630 --> 00:11:10.640
He succeeded, and Ben Solo rose up against
his uncle, Jedi Master Luke Skywalker, ending

00:11:10.640 --> 00:11:12.580
Luke's attempt to rebuild the Jedi Order.

00:11:12.890 --> 00:11:17.500
When he fully turned to the Dark Side, Ben
Solo changed his name to Kylo Ren and vowed

00:11:17.500 --> 00:11:19.860
to finish Vader's mission to eradicate the
Jedi.

00:11:19.860 --> 00:11:24.320
He even acquired Vader's old helmet, which
had been partially burned in his funeral pyre.

